    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Action Combat with 2 weapons<br></li><li>Challenging Bosses<br></li><li>5 Unique Levels</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>GAMEPLAY</u></strong></h2>Battle Record: Graizor is an action game with an emphasize on planning and pacing your movement. You have a sword and an energy rifle equipped and will need to think carefully about which weapon is right for any situation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620110/extras/23942fbaec78d3cd02dc06fc6cefce90.avif?t=1713548185\" width=616 height=352 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>STORY</u></strong></h2>After centuries of hostility between the nations of Altera and Pizon, the 2 nations are finally going to sign a peace treaty. However, before the treaty could be signed, a nefarious plot to sabotage the treaty will lead to the most destructive war the world has ever seen.  As the war drags on, a rebel army develops an advanced mobile weapon in secret that might be the worlds only hope to avoid complete annihilation. In a final fight for the fate of the planet, they will take to the front lines with there new weapon, <strong>GRAIZOR!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620110/extras/24339d18bd0078560fe829579c556abd.avif?t=1713548185\" width=616 height=352 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Action Combat with 2 weapons<br></li><li>Challenging Bosses<br></li><li>5 Unique Levels</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>GAMEPLAY</u></strong></h2>Battle Record: Graizor is an action game with an emphasize on planning and pacing your movement. You have a sword and an energy rifle equipped and will need to think carefully about which weapon is right for any situation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620110/extras/23942fbaec78d3cd02dc06fc6cefce90.avif?t=1713548185\" width=616 height=352 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>STORY</u></strong></h2>After centuries of hostility between the nations of Altera and Pizon, the 2 nations are finally going to sign a peace treaty. However, before the treaty could be signed, a nefarious plot to sabotage the treaty will lead to the most destructive war the world has ever seen.  As the war drags on, a rebel army develops an advanced mobile weapon in secret that might be the worlds only hope to avoid complete annihilation. In a final fight for the fate of the planet, they will take to the front lines with there new weapon, <strong>GRAIZOR!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620110/extras/24339d18bd0078560fe829579c556abd.avif?t=1713548185\" width=616 height=352 /></span>",
